    { "name": "maximum 128 ASCII characters", "reason": "abcdefghijklmnopabcdefghijklmnopabcdefghijklmnopabcdefghijklmnopabcdefghijklmnopabcdefghijklmnopabcdefghijklmnopabcdefghijklmnop", "valid": true },
    { "name": "129 ASCII characters", "reason": "abcdefghijklmnopabcdefghijklmnopabcdefghijklmnopabcdefghijklmnopabcdefghijklmnopabcdefghijklmnopabcdefghijklmnopabcdefghijklmnopx", "valid": false },
    { "name": "empty reason", "reason": "", "valid": false },
    { "name": "leading punctuation", "reason": "_invalid", "valid": false },
    { "name": "whitespace prose", "reason": "worker cancelled", "valid": false },
    { "name": "embedded newline", "reason": "worker\ncancelled", "valid": false },
